    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: e889af3b2f2b00ab359fda907dee93e023aeac3d -->\nReady for the maintainer to merge.\n\nThe two named tests use the existing catalog helpers. The focused test checks the case directory and both registered names. This meets #2971.\n\nResults on this machine, with upstream/main at `acd5b02d3e36a12745b11038012240781129d43c`:\n\n- Trial merge: clean; the PR already contains this main commit.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: PASS. The full `example_catalog` suite passed: 19 tests, zero failures, zero ignored.\n- `cargo test -j 32 -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog --no-run`: PASS.\n- `cargo clippy -j 32 -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: PASS.\n- Both new case tests passed. They check regeneration and script rebuilds against the committed NC bytes.\n- Heavy lanes: the dry-run maps to `app heavy: example_catalog`. The ignored-test listing contains zero tests. No release heavy tests ran.\n\nExtra suites run: none. The diff changes no fixture, golden, or importer code.\n\nSafety tier: not required. The diff adds tests and a decision record only. It changes no production G-code, geometry, collision checks, or stock simulation. No goldens moved. I did not rerun the author's source mutations. No UI files changed; screenshots are not required.\n\nRequested before merge: none.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
